  "prefLabel": "Ac 302.04 Application for Certification as CPA Through Endorsement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ac 302.04 Application for Certification as CPA Through Endorsement. Each applicant for certification as a CPA, who is licensed in another jurisdiction with substantially similar licensing requirements as this state as required by Plc 313.13 shall apply directly to the NASBA as described in Plc 301.02(c).\n\nSource. #14399, eff 12-5-25, EXPIRES: 12-5-35 (formerly Ac 301.05)",
